### Create an order that will be CONFIRMED (stock available)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-1001",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKY-GLASS-55", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 649.00 },
    { "sku": "SKY-STREAM-PUCK", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 39.99 }
  ]
}

### Create an order that will be REJECTED (SKY-SOUNDBOX has 0 stock)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-1001",
  "items": [ { "sku": "SKY-SOUNDBOX", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 249.00 } ]
}

### Validation error -> 400 with field errors
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "", "items": [ { "sku": "bad sku", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": -1 } ] }

### Get order (replace id with the one returned above)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List a customer's orders (paged, newest first)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders?customerId=CUST-1001&page=0&size=20

### Inventory: check stock
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory

### Inventory: restock
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory/SKY-SOUNDBOX/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 5 }
